{
  "id": "140101",
  "resourceId": 401,
  "name": "森",
  "skin": "後街的夢想",
  "spineVersion": "4.0",
  "skel": "c401_01_00.skel",
  "atlas": "c401_01_00.atlas",
  "defaultAnimation": "idle",
  "interactions": [
    {
      "id": "voice_01",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_01.mp3",
      "text": "啊～轉換器讓人喘不過氣了，教官，你用看的也覺得悶吧……？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_02.mp3",
      "text": "你不覺得這個口罩看起來好像一扯就掉了嗎？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_03.mp3",
      "text": "要給你一根珀派特條嗎？這可是沒開封的新品哦。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_04.mp3",
      "text": "兼職當女僕還蠻簡單的嘛！對不對？主、人。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_05.mp3",
      "text": "我這樣已經算是模範犯人了吧～",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_06.mp3",
      "text": "變美味的咒語？\n我還在培訓期間，所以我也不太清楚～",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_07.mp3",
      "text": "再沒有比我們教官更公正的人了～",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_08.mp3",
      "text": "口罩？沒關係，現在這樣也蠻舒服的～\n當然啦……如果是主人想幫我拿掉的話，那就另當別論啦！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_09.mp3",
      "text": "我們都是這種關係了，還不能幫我解開嗎……？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_10.mp3",
      "text": "主人，你今天想跟我玩些什麼呢？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_11.mp3",
      "text": "教官，差不多該替你加點分才行了～有沒有什麼立竿見影的方法呢？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_12.mp3",
      "text": "柔軟順滑……後面的咒語是怎麼唸的～？\n哎呀，你再指定我一次，我可能就會想起來啦！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_13.mp3",
      "text": "好無聊啊……我們好久沒聊天了，來聊聊吧，教官。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_14.mp3",
      "text": "什麼都不做，我會有點良心不安呢！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_15.mp3",
      "text": "我重獲新生之後你就不管我了嗎？\n教官，你就算再怎麼忙也不能這樣哦～扣你10分！",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_16.mp3",
      "text": "又不管我了嗎？扣你50分～！\n唔，可是你最近又對我蠻好的……那不然把50分加回來好了！",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_17.mp3",
      "text": "這裡的設施真好，還有很多可以聊天的對象……",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_18.mp3",
      "text": "這個傳單不准不拿！\n拿了之後，隨便你要丟掉或怎麼樣都可以～",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_19.mp3",
      "text": "你問我過得好不好？別擔心～這裡的人都很友好。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_20.mp3",
      "text": "唉……不然乾脆回更生館好了……",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_21.mp3",
      "text": "法院嗎……滿好的，無論如何都得按照法律來公平對待啊～",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_22.mp3",
      "text": "我的工作時間……是秘密。\n想知道的話，就來女僕咖啡廳找我吧！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_23.mp3",
      "text": "終於成功重獲新生了？為了慶祝，獎勵十分～！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_24.mp3",
      "text": "我從更生館出來以後，就在這裡很努力地兼職當女僕～\n你看我這麼乖這麼懂事，你會指定我吧？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_25.mp3",
      "text": "謝謝你～！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_26.mp3",
      "text": "謝謝你，主人～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_27.mp3",
      "text": "以我現在的實力，就算是前哨基地的最高長官也別想逃出我的魔掌。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_28.mp3",
      "text": "本來很累的，現在又有力氣啦！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_29.mp3",
      "text": "哈哈哈～繼續替我升級吧，再來。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_30.mp3",
      "text": "原來你是在關心我啊？謝謝你～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_31.mp3",
      "text": "怎麼還替我準備這些……我又沒有要求過。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_32.mp3",
      "text": "哇啊，這是什麼啊？謝謝你～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_33.mp3",
      "text": "這是在展現你的誠意嗎？\n我很感動，獎勵三十分～！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_34",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_34.mp3",
      "text": "其實店裡有規定不能收禮物，\n但這次我就破例收下啦。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_35.mp3",
      "text": "謝謝你，謝謝……不過物質上的東西可不是全部。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_36",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_36.mp3",
      "text": "你一直送我禮物的話，我可能會誤會哦～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_37",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_37.mp3",
      "text": "你終於開始懂我意思了嗎？",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_38",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_38.mp3",
      "text": "嗯～我也喜歡你啊，主、人♡",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_39",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_39.mp3",
      "text": "到哪都找不到像我們教官這樣的人了～",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_40",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_40.mp3",
      "text": "看來你是真心喜歡我？哎呀，怎麼辦～",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_41",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_41.mp3",
      "text": "你最近很照顧我哦，教官！\n看在你誠意滿滿的份上，獎勵三十分～！",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_42",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_42.mp3",
      "text": "說實話，我有點開心呢。\n不然，至少給你指定的權利怎麼樣？",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_43",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_43.mp3",
      "text": "為社會服務的時間到～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_44",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_44.mp3",
      "text": "或許，最好的地方反而是更生館……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_45",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_45.mp3",
      "text": "該去哪裡工作呢？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_46",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_46.mp3",
      "text": "是，主人～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_47",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_47.mp3",
      "text": "有沒有人能讓我騎肩車呢～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_48",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_48.mp3",
      "text": "可以點菜囉～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_49",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_49.mp3",
      "text": "大夥們～我們去賺點分數吧。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_50",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_50.mp3",
      "text": "哇啊，這就是所謂的奧客嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_51",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_51.mp3",
      "text": "1號囚犯，正在為方舟社會做出貢獻～！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_52",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_52.mp3",
      "text": "為了健康的生活，女僕出動啦！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_53",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_53.mp3",
      "text": "我們開誠布公地聊一聊吧？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_54",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_54.mp3",
      "text": "今天的客人也很多啊～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_55",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_55.mp3",
      "text": "啊～這裡還有比我更可惡的壞蛋。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_56",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_56.mp3",
      "text": "奧客退場啦～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_57",
      "category": "換彈I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_57.mp3",
      "text": "正在裝彈……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_58",
      "category": "換彈I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_58.mp3",
      "text": "休息一下吧……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_59",
      "category": "換彈II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_59.mp3",
      "text": "嘿咻。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_60",
      "category": "換彈II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_60.mp3",
      "text": "怎麼好像沒完沒了……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_61",
      "category": "換彈III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_61.mp3",
      "text": "今天晚餐吃什麼？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_62",
      "category": "換彈III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_62.mp3",
      "text": "結束之後，還要繼續兼職嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_63",
      "category": "可使用爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_63.mp3",
      "text": "現在可以解開了嗎，教官？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_64",
      "category": "可使用爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_64.mp3",
      "text": "正式開始吧？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_65",
      "category": "爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_65.mp3",
      "text": "你會聽我的，對吧？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_66",
      "category": "爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_66.mp3",
      "text": "你也想當女僕嗎？啊哈哈～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_67",
      "category": "全爆裂",
      "audio": "voices/voice_67.mp3",
      "text": "大家準備好嚴刑拷打了嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_68",
      "category": "全爆裂",
      "audio": "voices/voice_68.mp3",
      "text": "大家一起來教訓一下奧客～！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_69",
      "category": "消滅敵人I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_69.mp3",
      "text": "哈哈哈～！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_70",
      "category": "消滅敵人I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_70.mp3",
      "text": "解決掉一個了～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_71",
      "category": "消滅敵人II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_71.mp3",
      "text": "砰砰～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_72",
      "category": "消滅敵人II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_72.mp3",
      "text": "變美味吧～！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_73",
      "category": "消滅敵人III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_73.mp3",
      "text": "工作啊，工作。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_74",
      "category": "消滅敵人III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_74.mp3",
      "text": "好了，下一位奧客～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_75",
      "category": "被擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_75.mp3",
      "text": "啊……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_76",
      "category": "被擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_76.mp3",
      "text": "哈……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_77",
      "category": "被擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_77.mp3",
      "text": "好痛～",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_78",
      "category": "被擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_78.mp3",
      "text": "呃！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_79",
      "category": "被擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_79.mp3",
      "text": "啊～！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_80",
      "category": "被擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_80.mp3",
      "text": "哎呀呀……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_81",
      "category": "無法戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_81.mp3",
      "text": "啊啊……聽不懂人話呢，這些傢伙。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_82",
      "category": "無法戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_82.mp3",
      "text": "哈……怎麼都是奧客啊……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_83",
      "category": "戰鬥勝利",
      "audio": "voices/voice_83.mp3",
      "text": "看到沒？果然沒有溝通解決不了的問題～！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_84",
      "category": "戰鬥勝利",
      "audio": "voices/voice_84.mp3",
      "text": "我這麼拼命地戰鬥～你會獎勵我50分嗎？",
      "animation": "idle"
    }
  ]
}